{"author":{"id":"8d2e0405f08ac6c481f912544d6d5c0f58b2dc14a7e51ad4d499ee7a34567943"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795540006,"nonce":"lZB5c0wZ4uBPVgxr+YMEd2vYFJ8=","title":"XLA:CPU deadlock on four threads or fewer: batched LAPACK kernels in a steady fvm gas solve","message":"On the CPU, with four XLA threads or fewer (a 4-vCPU GitHub runner, `taskset -c 0-3`), the steady 8 x 8 Roe gas in\ntests/test_coupling_participants.py (`_steady_gas_2d`) never finished: CI shard core 2/4 timed out after 100 min on\nPR #345. JAX/jaxlib 0.10.1, scipy 1.18.\n\nWhat gdb shows (pinned with `taskset -c 0-3`): the main thread waits in `CpuPjRtRawLoadedExecutable::Execute`; all four\nXLA intra-op pool threads sit in `lapack_dtrsm_ffi` -\u003e `TriMatrixEquationSolver::Kernel` -\u003e `jax::ParallelBatchMap`,\neach waiting for the batch pieces it queued on the same pool. No thread is free to run them: a deadlock.\n\nThe batched kernels came from `jnp.linalg.inv` / `jnp.linalg.solve` on small per-face blocks in jno/_fvm/trace.py:\nthe Roe |A| (Denman-Beavers, 112x5x5 interior and 32x5x5 boundary faces), the face Newton steps (8x4x4, 8x1x1)\nand the algebraic-row completion. The program also holds JAX's spsolve host callback (lu() on the CPU). A pure-JAX\nscript with the same Denman-Beavers inverses in a fori_loop did not hang on 2 or 4 threads, so the trigger needs\nmore of the program than the kernels alone; not reduced further.\n\nWorkaround on feat/fvm: `_small_solve` in jno/_fvm/trace.py, an unrolled Gauss-Jordan elimination in jnp, for those\nthree call sites. Regression test: test_a_steady_roe_gas_solves_on_a_cpu_with_two_threads (a subprocess pinned to two\nthreads; it timed out at 400 s before the change).\n\nOpen:\n- Other jNO code that runs batched `jnp.linalg` (LU, triangular solves) inside a large CPU program on a small machine\n  may deadlock the same way. Only the fvm call sites were changed.\n- Check whether a newer jaxlib fixes ParallelBatchMap on the intra-op pool, and report upstream with a reduced\n  reproduction if not.\n\nCited as git-bug ad3129c in the commit history.","files":null}]}